
<section class="faq-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner reveal">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p>Find answers to common questions about the BuildWise construction management system.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="faq-body">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-filters">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="general">General</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="features">Features</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="projects">Projects</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="workers">Workers</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="materials">Materials</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="security">Security</button>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list" id="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="general">
        <button class="faq-question">What is BuildWise and who is it for?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>BuildWise is a construction management web application for organizing projects, properties, budgets, expenses, workers, materials, phases, tasks, and dashboard summaries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="general">
        <button class="faq-question">Do I need technical knowledge to use this system?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>No. BuildWise is designed with simple forms, lists, and dashboard pages so users can enter and review construction records without technical setup inside the app.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="features">
        <button class="faq-question">How does BuildWise help reduce cost overruns?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>BuildWise helps by keeping budgets, expenses, materials, workers, and progress records in one system. This makes it easier to compare planned and actual project costs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="projects">
        <button class="faq-question">Can I manage multiple projects at the same time?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>Yes. BuildWise supports multiple projects and provides an overall dashboard view for project, property, budget, expense, worker, and task summaries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="workers">
        <button class="faq-question">How is worker attendance and wages tracked?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>BuildWise stores worker profiles, daily wage rates, active status, project assignments, and wage payment records. These records are used in dashboard and report summaries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="materials">
        <button class="faq-question">Can I track material purchases and suppliers?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>Yes. You can manage a material catalog and record material purchases with quantities, units, costs, and supplier details when available.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal" data-category="security">
        <button class="faq-question">Is my data safe?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">
            <p>User data should be handled responsibly and should not be shared without permission. BuildWise is intended for project and construction management records.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-cta">
      <h2 class="reveal">Still have questions?</h2>
      <p>Can't find the answer you're looking for? Send a message through the contact page.</p>
      <a href="/Home/Contact">Contact Support &nbsp;→</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
